WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:30.708
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:34.958
Lord Krishna had shed light on
the importance of bhakti-yoga.

3
00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:37.500
In this verse too, He emphasises

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.250
the simplicity and ease of devotion.

5
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.500
The worship of other devas
requires complex rituals

6
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.000
and many costly materials.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.666
But entirely different from these, Lord Krishna

8
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:53.750
accepts even the most ordinary offering,

9
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:57.083
when it is given with pure devotion.

10
00:00:57.083 --> 00:00:59.875
This verse reveals the intimate and personal

11
00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:02.750
nature of devotion to Lord Krishna.

12
00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.875
So let us listen.

13
00:01:09.583 --> 00:01:10.875
In this verse,

14
00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:14.875
Lord Krishna emphasises the
simplicity of His worship.

15
00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:18.958
Unlike other forms of worship, He accepts
even the most ordinary offerings,

16
00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:21.666
like a flower, a leaf,

17
00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:25.583
a fruit, or even just water,

18
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:29.208
if they are offered with sincere devotion.

19
00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:34.333
Lord Krishna says – My attention is
not on the material value of the offering,

20
00:01:34.333 --> 00:01:38.416
but on the love and sincerity hidden behind it.

21
00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:40.875
By mentioning bhakti multiple times,

22
00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:45.416
Lord Krishna shows that devotion is the
central element that makes the humblest,

23
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:50.458
smallest gift priceless to Him.

24
00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:54.291
This simplicity is what makes
Lord Krishna unique.

25
00:01:54.291 --> 00:01:57.041
The worship of devas often
requires complex methods

26
00:01:57.041 --> 00:02:00.208
and various materials.

27
00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:02.666
But Lord Krishna makes clear that

28
00:02:02.666 --> 00:02:05.750
He wants only devotion offered from the heart.

29
00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:10.958
He responds not to wealth or grandeur,
 but only to pure love.

30
00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:13.291
Anything offered with love and a pure heart

31
00:02:13.291 --> 00:02:18.375
connects the devotee personally with Him.

32
00:02:18.375 --> 00:02:19.541
This verse

33
00:02:19.541 --> 00:02:24.250
reminds us that Lord Krishna's
love is accessible to all.

34
00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:29.375
There is no wall of wealth, position,
 caste, or status.

35
00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:34.958
True worship is not in outward show,
but in the unblemished devotion of the heart.

36
00:02:34.958 --> 00:02:38.125
And through this verse, Lord Krishna

37
00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:41.541
invites us to build a loving relationship

38
00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:43.333
with Him.

39
00:02:48.041 --> 00:02:52.416
The power of simplicity in life is extraordinary.

40
00:02:52.416 --> 00:02:54.208
Simplicity

41
00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:57.500
is a precious gem

42
00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:02.625
that people today often overlook.

43
00:03:02.625 --> 00:03:06.500
You may think that only grand human efforts

44
00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:11.000
or expensive gifts carry value,

45
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.041
but

46
00:03:13.041 --> 00:03:16.500
this is only an illusion.

47
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.708
When a mother

48
00:03:18.708 --> 00:03:22.500
gently caresses her child with love,

49
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.958
that touch

50
00:03:25.958 --> 00:03:32.000
is the most precious thing in the world.

51
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.916
I have always shown

52
00:03:34.916 --> 00:03:38.333
that the most ordinary things –

53
00:03:38.333 --> 00:03:44.333
a leaf, a flower, or even just water –

54
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:49.666
touch Me deeply.

55
00:03:49.666 --> 00:03:53.125
Devotion and love

56
00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:55.541
lie not in the object,

57
00:03:55.541 --> 00:03:58.416
but in the feeling

58
00:03:58.416 --> 00:04:00.708
hidden behind it.

59
00:04:00.708 --> 00:04:06.500
Have you ever paused to look
at the beauty of the full moon

60
00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.875
for a few moments?

61
00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:12.541
How much beauty

62
00:04:12.541 --> 00:04:17.416
is hidden in its simplicity?

63
00:04:17.416 --> 00:04:19.500
In your life too,

64
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:23.541
appreciate such simple things –

65
00:04:23.541 --> 00:04:27.583
a kind word, a warm smile,

66
00:04:27.583 --> 00:04:30.625
or genuine empathy.

67
00:04:30.625 --> 00:04:35.166
These small acts may not seem extraordinary,

68
00:04:35.166 --> 00:04:42.625
but they carry the wonderful
power to bring joy into life.

69
00:04:42.625 --> 00:04:45.916
Let go of the idea that only grand

70
00:04:45.916 --> 00:04:49.916
actions matter.

71
00:04:49.916 --> 00:04:52.083
When in the right direction

72
00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:55.833
and with love you take small steps,

73
00:04:55.833 --> 00:05:00.083
that is the beginning of great change.

74
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:04.791
And when you live with this understanding,

75
00:05:04.791 --> 00:05:08.000
you find contentment in small but

76
00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:12.750
meaningful moments.

77
00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:15.208
And remember,

78
00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:20.875
in simplicity itself is the experience of true joy.

79
00:05:20.875 --> 00:05:25.125
This is the path of truth.

80
00:05:29.583 --> 00:05:32.625
Have you ever thought

81
00:05:32.625 --> 00:05:35.708
what defines the depth

82
00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:38.875
of a relationship?

83
00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:45.458
In family life, it is easy to get
caught up in appearances.

84
00:05:45.458 --> 00:05:49.750
To judge others by what they do

85
00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:54.541
on the outside is easy.

86
00:05:54.541 --> 00:05:56.208
But

87
00:05:56.208 --> 00:05:59.833
just as a seed hidden beneath the soil

88
00:05:59.833 --> 00:06:04.250
holds the potential of an entire tree,

89
00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:09.541
in the same way the feeling behind every action

90
00:06:09.541 --> 00:06:13.583
is its true essence.

91
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:17.583
So understand their feeling,

92
00:06:17.583 --> 00:06:21.083
not the outward appearance.

93
00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:23.958
Just as Sudama's

94
00:06:23.958 --> 00:06:28.583
or Vidura's wife's simple offerings

95
00:06:28.583 --> 00:06:31.125
for Lord Krishna

96
00:06:31.125 --> 00:06:35.125
because of their heartfelt feeling

97
00:06:35.125 --> 00:06:36.958
became priceless.

98
00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:41.000
Always remember what I have taught –

99
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:45.208
how large the gift or offering is,

100
00:06:45.208 --> 00:06:49.166
or how valuable, is not what matters,

101
00:06:49.166 --> 00:06:54.500
but the feeling behind it –

102
00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:57.166
the feeling matters.

103
00:06:57.166 --> 00:06:59.125
See –

104
00:06:59.125 --> 00:07:03.833
in a family, when parents for their children

105
00:07:03.833 --> 00:07:07.000
make even a simple meal,

106
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:10.750
food made with love nourishes more than

107
00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:16.166
any expensive restaurant's dish.

108
00:07:16.166 --> 00:07:21.541
In your relationships, try to look beyond doubt.

109
00:07:21.541 --> 00:07:23.708
Be patient.

110
00:07:23.708 --> 00:07:27.500
See the hearts of those around you.

111
00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:31.250
See the love and sincerity hidden in them.

112
00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:36.125
Along with that, be aware of your own actions,

113
00:07:36.125 --> 00:07:40.708
and ask yourself this question –

114
00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:43.666
when you listen to your husband

115
00:07:43.666 --> 00:07:47.375
or wife or partner,

116
00:07:47.375 --> 00:07:52.041
do you really

117
00:07:52.041 --> 00:07:55.250
try to understand the feelings
behind their words?

118
00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:57.291
Remember,

119
00:07:57.291 --> 00:08:01.708
when you focus only on the surface,

120
00:08:01.708 --> 00:08:06.625
you lose the deep connection of relationships.

121
00:08:06.625 --> 00:08:08.250
So

122
00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.416
teach your family

123
00:08:11.416 --> 00:08:14.250
to value sincerity over grandeur,

124
00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:19.000
kindness over outward show,

125
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:23.291
because the family that sees
with the eyes of the heart,

126
00:08:23.291 --> 00:08:27.541
their love remains unshakeable, and there trust

127
00:08:27.541 --> 00:08:33.000
and a stream of compassion flow continuously.

128
00:08:37.333 --> 00:08:39.625
At your workplace,

129
00:08:39.625 --> 00:08:44.416
look at a person who makes big promises,

130
00:08:44.416 --> 00:08:49.041
builds grand plans, and never completes them.

131
00:08:49.041 --> 00:08:52.916
In contrast, look at the person

132
00:08:52.916 --> 00:08:55.250
who steadily, consistently,

133
00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:58.708
and with integrity does their work.

134
00:08:58.708 --> 00:09:00.291
Remember,

135
00:09:00.291 --> 00:09:06.208
at the workplace, the simplicity
and purity of feeling in your actions

136
00:09:06.416 --> 00:09:10.333
are a reflection of your character.

137
00:09:10.333 --> 00:09:13.291
Often people with big talk

138
00:09:13.291 --> 00:09:17.125
and plans wish to impress others,

139
00:09:17.125 --> 00:09:20.458
thinking that this will earn them respect.

140
00:09:20.458 --> 00:09:22.916
But just as drops of water

141
00:09:22.916 --> 00:09:28.583
come together to form an ocean,
in the same way, small

142
00:09:28.583 --> 00:09:33.416
sincere efforts lay the
foundation of great success.

143
00:09:33.416 --> 00:09:36.083
I remind you

144
00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:38.791
that what truly matters

145
00:09:38.791 --> 00:09:44.833
is the sincerity behind your work.

146
00:09:44.833 --> 00:09:46.708
See,

147
00:09:46.708 --> 00:09:48.416
when a teacher

148
00:09:48.416 --> 00:09:52.916
teaches their students with full dedication,

149
00:09:52.916 --> 00:09:55.333
then the gift of his knowledge

150
00:09:55.333 --> 00:09:59.291
is more valuable than any wealth.

151
00:09:59.291 --> 00:10:03.458
In the same way, even the most
ordinary effort, when made

152
00:10:03.458 --> 00:10:08.666
with genuine feeling, holds immense value.

153
00:10:08.666 --> 00:10:14.583
Do you know that a small laugh, a small smile

154
00:10:14.583 --> 00:10:18.041
can change the atmosphere of an office,

155
00:10:18.041 --> 00:10:20.708
and simple, clean, and sincere

156
00:10:20.708 --> 00:10:23.791
behaviour not only builds mutual trust,

157
00:10:23.791 --> 00:10:29.791
but also creates an environment
of respect at the workplace.

158
00:10:29.791 --> 00:10:35.416
So at your workplace, be someone

159
00:10:35.416 --> 00:10:39.208
whose actions reflect integrity,

160
00:10:39.208 --> 00:10:41.875
whose feeling is clear.

161
00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:45.625
Your focus is not just on looking impressive,

162
00:10:45.625 --> 00:10:48.708
but on doing the right work,

163
00:10:48.708 --> 00:10:52.041
and this is the essence of karma-yoga –

164
00:10:52.041 --> 00:10:55.875
acting without selfish desire.
